{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_0EAA026C","title":"Garnet gives his heart - maybe","entry":"Dlg_0EAA026C::entry","exit":"Dlg_0EAA026C::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_977B0BBA","articyId":"72057645577644565","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"My kid has been talking about you. A lot.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My kid has been talking about you. A lot.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":400.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42427","byteOffset":30378264,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_7473F486","articyId":"72057645577644572","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"That's... good?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's... good?","TextSheVersion":"That's... good?","TextTheyVersion":"That's... good?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":700.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35831","byteOffset":27902608,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_D0227AF0","articyId":"72057645577644577","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"That's great. She's very picky. And a good kid.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's great. She's very picky. And a good kid.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1000.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49943","byteOffset":33236496,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_19E90E27","articyId":"72057645577644583","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"We got on well.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We got on well.","TextSheVersion":"We got on well.","TextTheyVersion":"We got on well."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17319","byteOffset":14441080,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_5738E3AC","articyId":"72057645577644588","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"I know! Look... It hasn't been easy for me and Mila since Flora died. She... she did a lot for us. I had to learn - and quickly - how to be a better dad. And I've done ok.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I know! Look... It hasn't been easy for me and Mila since Flora died. She... she did a lot for us. I had to learn - and quickly - how to be a better dad. And I've done ok.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42490","byteOffset":30401592,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_35FC0C08","articyId":"72057645577644594","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You're doing alright Garnet.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're doing alright Garnet.","TextSheVersion":"You're doing alright Garnet.","TextTheyVersion":"You're doing alright Garnet."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41975","byteOffset":30206920,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_1FC9C9E9","articyId":"72057645577644599","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"I don't have many friends. I guess I've kinda forgot how to keep a friendship going, you know. But I was thinking, when this whole LUZ thing is over...","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't have many friends. I guess I've kinda forgot how to keep a friendship going, you know. But I was thinking, when this whole LUZ thing is over...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29811","byteOffset":19158840,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_8B936BC8","articyId":"72057645577644605","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Yeah?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah?","TextSheVersion":"Yeah?","TextTheyVersion":"Yeah?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43295","byteOffset":30707976,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_6544B39A","articyId":"72057645577644630","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"She's a good kid.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"She's a good kid.","TextSheVersion":"She's a good kid.","TextTheyVersion":"She's a good kid."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45943","byteOffset":31713912,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_E5E7E13C","articyId":"72057645577644640","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"Maybe we go on a trip? Us three. I know this place, on the other side of the city. Far away from the LUZ. It's actually where me, Flora and Mila would go on holiday.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Maybe we go on a trip? Us three. I know this place, on the other side of the city. Far away from the LUZ. It's actually where me, Flora and Mila would go on holiday.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37900","byteOffset":28673328,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_62E61B6B","articyId":"72057645577644646","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sounds nice.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds nice.","TextSheVersion":"Sounds nice.","TextTheyVersion":"Sounds nice."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49002","byteOffset":32879216,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_A3034DF8","articyId":"72057645577644652","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"Look, if it's too weird, just let me know. But... It's where Flora's ashes are. I scattered them in this little park. I'd love to take you there. And tell you what she was like.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, if it's too weird, just let me know. But... It's where Flora's ashes are. I scattered them in this little park. I'd love to take you there. And tell you what she was like.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44774","byteOffset":31272384,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_D43C226C","articyId":"72057645577644667","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Are you going to be ok Garnet?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you going to be ok Garnet?","TextSheVersion":"Are you going to be ok Garnet?","TextTheyVersion":"Are you going to be ok Garnet?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3700.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41559","byteOffset":30050544,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_3D539C9D","articyId":"72057645577644673","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"I think so. I think meeting you, and seeing how you are with Mila... it's kinda pulling me out of a bad place. But I know I still got a long way to go.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think so. I think meeting you, and seeing how you are with Mila... it's kinda pulling me out of a bad place. But I know I still got a long way to go.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4000.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45024","byteOffset":31366648,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_C0F47A94","articyId":"72057645577644682","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You'll get there.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You'll get there.","TextSheVersion":"You'll get there.","TextTheyVersion":"You'll get there."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36515","byteOffset":28159712,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_173F23CC","articyId":"72057645577644688","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"I feel like if I take someone there... like a new friend or something, somehow Flora will know that I'm doing ok. And she can rest.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I feel like if I take someone there... like a new friend or something, somehow Flora will know that I'm doing ok. And she can rest.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4600.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30153","byteOffset":19286752,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_D79ED885","articyId":"72057645577644694","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sure thing.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure thing.","TextSheVersion":"Sure thing.","TextTheyVersion":"Sure thing."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22945","byteOffset":16564728,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_70163762","articyId":"72057645577644700","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"So you'll do it?!","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So you'll do it?!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5200.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50843","byteOffset":33574712,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_FAB92506","articyId":"72057645577644710","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sounds nice.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds nice.","TextSheVersion":"Sounds nice.","TextTheyVersion":"Sounds nice."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5500.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45646","byteOffset":31600464,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_9232ADFD","articyId":"72057645577644716","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"CORA be damned! Well, I cannot wait. This has really made my day. I'll plan the trip. A month, maybe two? I don't care how long it takes for this LUZ to clear. I'm just happy I got something to look forward to.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"CORA be damned! Well, I cannot wait. This has really made my day. I'll plan the trip. A month, maybe two? I don't care how long it takes for this LUZ to clear. I'm just happy I got something to look forward to.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5800.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38175","byteOffset":28776232,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_54C9227A","articyId":"72057645577644722","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Me too. And Mila said there is pizza at home. With capers.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me too. And Mila said there is pizza at home. With capers.","TextSheVersion":"Me too. And Mila said there is pizza at home. With capers.","TextTheyVersion":"Me too. And Mila said there is pizza at home. With capers."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6100.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29683","byteOffset":19110408,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_7FB1E48D","articyId":"72057645577644728","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"Pizza at home, and a new... friend, too. Damn, what a great day! Hey, you wanna hear one last joke?","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Pizza at home, and a new... friend, too. Damn, what a great day! Hey, you wanna hear one last joke?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6400.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22198","byteOffset":16283680,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_2060E8F0","articyId":"72057645577644738","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"For you and Mila, sure.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"For you and Mila, sure.","TextSheVersion":"For you and Mila, sure.","TextTheyVersion":"For you and Mila, sure."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5500.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21949","byteOffset":16190752,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_7C701FA9","articyId":"72057645577644746","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sure.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure.","TextSheVersion":"Sure.","TextTheyVersion":"Sure."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6700.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22082","byteOffset":16240696,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_499098BC","articyId":"72057645577644752","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"Knock knock.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Knock knock.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7000.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46079","byteOffset":31763088,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_9007DC6C","articyId":"72057645577644760","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Whose there?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whose there?","TextSheVersion":"Whose there?","TextTheyVersion":"Whose there?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7300.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29318","byteOffset":18971776,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_A0AF7F65","articyId":"72057645577644766","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"Pauline.","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Pauline.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7600.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26457","byteOffset":17890624,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_85FA2CA9","articyId":"72057645577644774","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Pauline who?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Pauline who?","TextSheVersion":"Pauline who?","TextTheyVersion":"Pauline who?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7900.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32998","byteOffset":20368424,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_F85899FE","articyId":"72057645577644780","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"I think I'm Pauline in lo... in friend with you!","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think I'm Pauline in lo... in friend with you!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":8200.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45088","byteOffset":31390480,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_1086929D","articyId":"72057645577644788","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"\"In friend with you?\"","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"\"In friend with you?\"","TextSheVersion":"\"In friend with you?\"","TextTheyVersion":"\"In friend with you?\""},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":8500.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36552","byteOffset":28172992,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_C1C07AB3","articyId":"72057645577644794","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Were you going to say \"in love with you?\"","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Were you going to say \"in love with you?\"","TextSheVersion":"Were you going to say \"in love with you?\"","TextTheyVersion":"Were you going to say \"in love with you?\""},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":8500.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42650","byteOffset":30462152,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_B92E1528","articyId":"72057645577644802","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Garnet","text":"Sorry! Haha. I didn't think that one through... I'll, uh, just go. See you for the trip! Just don't get murdered or run away before the LUZ finishes, ok?","speakerId":"Ntt_FC3DC3CE","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sorry! Haha. I didn't think that one through... I'll, uh, just go. See you for the trip! Just don't get murdered or run away before the LUZ finishes, ok?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":8800.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46673","byteOffset":31989608,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_8E98DA00","articyId":"72057645577644810","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Try my best!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Try my best!","TextSheVersion":"Try my best!","TextTheyVersion":"Try my best!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":9100.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33534","byteOffset":20568968,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_49F57E27","articyId":"72057821671319317","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"A lot to talk about, I guess.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A lot to talk about, I guess.","TextSheVersion":"A lot to talk about, I guess.","TextTheyVersion":"A lot to talk about, I guess."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":700.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44773","byteOffset":31272072,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_8C2759C1","articyId":"72057821671319349","type":"choice","class